New tab scenes
--------------
Drawn live on this PC with three.js (https://threejs.org, MIT licence; the copy
used is ui/vendor/three.module.js). Code: ui/scenes/living.

props/   Temples, gates, trees, lanterns, figures and the rest were modelled and
         rendered by the Browsery developer in Blender (tools/render/props.py) as
         an albedo and a normal map each, so every scene can relight them.
tex/moon.jpg
         From the moon map by Solar System Scope / INOVE
         (https://www.solarsystemscope.com/textures/), CC BY 4.0
         (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), resized.
tex/signs.webp, text/
         Japanese shop signs and poster titles set in Noto Sans CJK and Noto Serif
         CJK (© Google, SIL Open Font License 1.1) and baked into images
         (tools/render/signs.py, tools/render/retro_text.py).
posters/, thumbs/
         Frames of the scenes themselves, shown when WebGL is unavailable and in
         the scene picker.

Everything else (skies, clouds, water, grass, fog, light) is generated from
noise and simple shapes while the scene runs; nothing is downloaded.
